== Shikigai Shrines (式外社) ==
Shrines that existed at the time of compiling the {{ill|Engishiki|de|Engishiki|ja|延喜式|zh|延喜式}} Kamimyōchō but are not recorded within it.
* {{ill|Jōwa Shrine|de|Jōwa Shrine|ja|城輪神社|zh|城輪神社}}: In volume 10 of {{ill|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|de|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|ja|日本三代実録|zh|日本三代实录}}, it is regarded as “Jōwa-gami”<ref group="脚注" name=sandai>{{ill|Jōgan|de|Jōgan|ja|Jōgan|zh|Jōgan}} 7th year, {{ill|2月27日 (old calendar)|de|2月27日 (old calendar)|ja|2月27日 (旧暦)|zh|2月27日 (旧历)}}
 ({{ill|865|de|865|ja|865|zh|865}} {{ill|3月28日|de|3月28日|ja|3月28日|zh|3月28日}}) clause “In Dewa Province, the primary shrine Ichinomiya of Jōwa deity is Ranked sixth and the attendant Takami deity is Ranked below fifth.”</ref>.
* {{ill|Koshio Shrine|de|Koshio Shrine|ja|古四王神社|zh|古四王神社}}: In volume 10 of {{ill|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|de|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|ja|日本三代実録|zh|日本三代实录}}, it is identified as “Takami-kami”.<ref group="脚注" name=sandai/>

