[[en:List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province]] [[sn:List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province]] [[ja:出羽国の式内社一覧]] [[sn:出羽国の式内社一覧]] [[de:List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province]][[Category:Shikinaisha bottom]][[Category:Shikinaisha bottom]] [[Category:qq]][[sn:List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province]][[Category:qq]]

[[Category:Shikinaisha top]] [[Category:Shikinaisha top]] This is a '''List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province'''. Or the list of shrines in [[Dewa Province]] which is present in the {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|ja|延喜式神名帳}}. On this page we will also cover the {{ill|Shikigeisha|ja|式外社|1=Shikigeisha}} of [[Dewa Province]] which are shrines that are known to have existed at that time due to other historical records, such as the [[Rikkokushi]], but for some reason were excluded from the {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|ja|延喜式神名帳}}. We will cover them in a separate list to avoid confusion.[[Category:edited lists]] [[Category:Lists of Shikinaisha by location]]
