awa Shrine”]</ref> || {{ill|Akita Prefecture|de|Akita Prefecture|ja|秋田県|zh|秋田县|12=draft}} {{ill|Minamiakita District|de|Minamiakita District|ja|南秋田郡|zh|南秋田郡|12=draft}} {{ill|Hachirōgata Town|de|Hachirōgata Town|ja|八郎潟町|zh|八郎潟町|12=draft}} – Uradachi |}
== Shikigai Shrines (式外社) == Shrines that existed at the time of compiling the {{ill|Engishiki|de|Engishiki|ja|延喜式|zh|延喜式|12=draft}} Kamimyōchō but are not recorded within it. * {{ill|Jōwa Shrine|de|Jōwa Shrine|ja|城輪神社|zh|城輪神社|12=draft}}: In volume 10 of {{ill|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|de|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|ja|日本三代実録|zh|日本三代实录|12=draft}}, it is regarded as “Jōwa-gami”<ref group="脚注" name=sandai>{{ill|Jōgan|de|Jōgan|ja|Jōgan|zh|Jōgan|12=draft}} 7th year, {{ill|2月27日 (old calendar)|de|2月27日 (old calendar)|ja|2月27日 (旧暦)|zh|2月27日 (旧历)|12=draft}} ({{ill|865|de|865|ja|865|zh|865|12=draft}} {{ill|3月28日|de|3月28日|ja|3月28日|zh|3月28日|12=draft}}) clause “In Dewa Province, the primary shrine Ichinomiya of Jōwa deity is Ranked sixth and the attendant Takami deity is Ranked below fifth.”</ref>. * {{ill|Koshio Shrine|de|Koshio Shrine|ja|古四王神社|zh|古四王神社|12=draft}}: In volume 10 of {{ill|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|de|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|ja|日本三代実録|zh|日本三代实录|12=draft}}, it is identified as “Takami-kami”.<ref group="脚注" name=sandai/>
