'''{{ill|Dewa no Shikinai-sha Ichiran|de|Dewa no Shikinai-sha Ichiran|ja|出羽国の式内社一覧|zh|出羽国の式内社一覧|12=draft}}''' (Dewa no Kuni no Shikinaisha Ichiran) is a list of {{ill|Shrine|de|Shrine|ja|神社|zh|神社|12=draft}} – that is, the shrines recorded in the 9th and 10th volumes of the {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|de|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|ja|延喜式神名帳|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|zh|延喜式神名帳|12=draft}} (“Kamimyōchō Jōge”) – in addition to those shrines designated as {{ill|Shikinai Shrines|de|Shikinai Shrines|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|zh|式内社|12=draft}} and their corresponding {{ill|Candidate Shrines|de|Kandidatschreine|ja|論社|zh|論社|12=draft}} that are classified as part of {{ill|Dewa Province|de|Dewa Province|ja|出羽国|zh|出羽国|12=draft}}.
It also includes shrines which, although they existed at the time of the compilation of the {{ill|Engishiki|de|Engishiki|ja|延喜式|zh|延喜式|12=draft}}, are not recorded in its Kamimyōchō – the so‐called “{{ill|Shikigai Shrines|de|Shikigai Shrines|ja|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|zh|式外社|12=draft}}”.
