== Shikigai Shrines (式外社) == Shrines that existed at the time of compiling the [[:en:Engishiki|Engishiki]] Kamimyōchō but are not recorded within it. * {{ill|Jōwa Shrine|de|Jōwa Shrine|ja|城輪神社|zh|城輪神社|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jōwa Shrine|qq=}}: In volume 10 of [[:en:Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku]], it is regarded as “Jōwa-gami”<ref group="脚注" name=sandai>{{ill|Jōgan|de|Jōgan|ja|Jōgan|zh|Jōgan|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jōgan|qq=}} 7th year, {{ill|2月27日 (old calendar)|de|2月27日 (old calendar)|ja|2月27日 (旧暦)|zh|2月27日 (旧历)|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/2月27日 (old calendar)|qq=}} ({{ill|865|de|865|ja|865|zh|865|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/865|qq=}} [[:en:March 28|3月28日]]) clause “In Dewa Province, the primary shrine Ichinomiya of Jōwa deity is Ranked sixth and the attendant Takami deity is Ranked below fifth.”</ref>. * [[:en:Koshiō Shrine|Koshio Shrine]]: In volume 10 of [[:en:Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku|Nihon Sandai Jitsuroku]], it is identified as “Takami-kami”.<ref group="脚注" name=sandai/>
