t of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} {{afc comment|1=page target for move is at {{ill|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|de|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|ja|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|zh|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} {{afc comment|1=page target for move is at {{ill|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|de|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|ja|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|zh|List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/List of Shikinaisha in Dewa Province|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} {{afc comment|1=Switching over to deprecating the templates. So things might be a bit unexpected.{{ill|Immanuelle|de|Immanuelle|ja|User:Immanuelle|zh|Immanuelle|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Immanuelle|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} {{afc comment|1=If this is in the format "List of Shikinaisha in X" then I have linked all existing shrines into the table. Otherwise I have not. Translation of the texts will come later as it is a lot less difficult than the tables. Exception if there is another comment explaining the exception below{{ill|Immanuelle|de|Immanuelle|ja|User:Immanuelle|zh|Immanuelle|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Immanuelle|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}
'''出羽国の式内社一覧'''（でわのくにのしきないしゃいちらん）は、『[[Engishiki]]』第9巻・第10巻「神名帳上下」（[[延喜式神名帳]]）に記載のある[[神社]]、いわゆる「{{ill|Shikinaisha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|2=ja|3=式内社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikinaisha|13=User:Immanuelle|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|lt=Shikinaisha}}」およびその[[論社]]のうち、[[出羽国]]に分類されている神社の一覧。
また『延喜式』神名帳の編纂当時に存在したが同帳に記載の無い神社、いわゆる「[[式外社]]」についても付記する。
({{ill|talk|de|talk|ja|User talk:Immanuelle|zh|talk|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/talk|qq=}}) 05:35, 31 March 2025 (UTC)}} {{ill|Immanuelle|de|Immanuelle|ja|User:Immanuelle|zh|Immanuelle|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Immanuelle|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} ({{ill|talk|de|talk|ja|User talk:Immanuelle|zh|talk|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/talk|qq=}}) 09:49, 26 March 2025 (UTC)}} - {{ill|Immanuelle|de|Immanuelle|ja|User:Immanuelle|zh|Immanuelle|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Immanuelle|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} ({{ill|talk|de|talk|ja|User talk:Immanuelle|zh|talk|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/talk|qq=}}) 09:48, 26 March 2025 (UTC)}} {{ill|Immanuelle|de|Immanuelle|ja|User:Immanuelle|zh|Immanuelle|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Immanuelle|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} ({{ill|talk|de|talk|ja|User talk:Immanuelle|zh|talk|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/talk|qq=}}) 09:48, 26 March 2025 (UTC)}} ({{ill|talk|de|talk|ja|User talk:Immanuelle|zh|talk|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/talk|qq=}}) 05:01, 18 March 2025 (UTC)}} ({{ill|talk|de|talk|ja|User talk:Immanuelle|zh|talk|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/talk|qq=}}) 05:34, 17 March 2025 (UTC)}}
'''{{ill|Dewa no Shikinaisha Ichiran|de|Dewa no Shikinaisha Ichiran|ja|出羽国の式内社一覧|zh|出羽国の式内社一覧|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Dewa no Shikinaisha Ichiran|qq=}}''' (Dewa no Kuni no Shikinaisha Ichiran) is a list of [[:en:Shinto shrine|Shrine]] – that is, the shrines recorded in the 9th and 10th volumes of the {{ill|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|de|Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|ja|延喜式神名帳|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|zh|延喜式神名帳|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Engishiki Jinmyōchō|13=User:Immanuelle/Engishiki Jinmyōchō|qq=}} (“Kamimyōchō Jōge”) – in addition to those shrines designated as {{ill|Shikinaisha|de|Shikinaisha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|2=ja|3=式内社|qq=draft|1=Shikinaisha|zh|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|2=ja|3=式内社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikinaisha|13=User:Immanuelle|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|lt=Shikinaisha}} and their corresponding {{ill|Candidate Shrines|de|Kandidatschreine|ja|論社|1=candidate shrines|2=ja|3=論社|lt=candidate|zh|論社|1=candidate shrines|2=ja|3=論社|lt=candidate|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Candidate Shrines|13=User:Immanuelle/candidate shrines|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 延喜式神名帳}} that are classified as part of [[:en:Dewa Province|Dewa Province]].
It also includes shrines which, although they existed at the time of the compilation of the [[:en:Engishiki|Engishiki]], are not recorded in its Kamimyōchō – the so‐called “{{ill|Shikigai Shrines|de|Shikigai Shrines|ja|式外社|1=Shikigeisha|zh|式外社|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikigai Shrines|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikigeisha|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 延喜式神名帳|comment=enwiki is a redirect}}”.
